#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/6-vendor_arms.md:3
#: aba70c2c92ed4dc590bdee9fa4e08c65
msgid ""
"Brand trees that the public [robot_descriptions "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/main/README.md) lists as submodules. **Public"
" remotes** (browse HTTPS): [robot-descriptions-tianji](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-tianji), [robot-descriptions-"
"rokae](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-rokae), [robot-"
"descriptions-gento](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"gento). **Still private** (404 without access; no browseable links): "
"Fairino (`robot-descriptions-fairino`) and Agibot G2 "
"(`agibot-g2-description`). After access to a private remote, follow "
"**those package READMEs**. Public `hardware:=` keys remain "
"`mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` / `real` (there is **no** "
"`hardware:=mock`)."
msgstr ""
"公开 [robot_descriptions README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_descriptions/blob/main/README.md) 列为子模块的品牌树。**公开远端**（可浏览 HTTPS）："
"[robot-descriptions-tianji](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-"
"descriptions-tianji)、[robot-descriptions-rokae](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-rokae)、[robot-descriptions-"
"gento](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-gento)。**仍为私有**"
"（无权限 404；不提供可浏览链接）：Fairino（`robot-descriptions-fairino`）与智元 G2"
"（`agibot-g2-description`）。开通私有远端后以**那些包 README** 为准。公开 `hardware:=` 键仍是 "
"`mock_components` / `gz` / `isaac` / `real`（**没有** `hardware:=mock`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/6-vendor_arms.md:5
#: cc110013445543f3a0ab2f456a9b14fd
msgid "Init selection vs GitHub remotes"
msgstr "初始化选择与 GitHub 远端"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/6-vendor_arms.md:8
#: 632ea9923eac4fd698aafb55872802df
msgid ""
"[`open-deploy-ws` `submodules_visibility.conf`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/main/submodules_visibility.conf) still "
"marks `manipulator/Tianji` and `manipulator/Rokae` as `private`, so "
"`./init_repo.sh` does **not** pull them by default. That is **init "
"selection**, not GitHub visibility — those remotes are public. The conf "
"has no Gento line (Gento is on `robot_descriptions` `feature/agilex` "
"only). Do not recursive-init from `open-deploy-ws`."
msgstr ""
"[`open-deploy-ws` `submodules_visibility.conf`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/main/submodules_visibility.conf) 仍把 "
"`manipulator/Tianji` 与 `manipulator/Rokae` 标为 `private`，因此 "
"`./init_repo.sh` **默认不会**拉取它们。这是**初始化选择**，不是 GitHub 可见性——那些远端已公开。该配置没有 "
"Gento 行（Gento 只在 `robot_descriptions` 的 `feature/agilex`）。不要从 "
"`open-deploy-ws` 递归初始化。"

